{"id":21942,"slug":"ossos","title":"Ossos","year":1997,"country":"Portugal","duration":98,"spine":509,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/21942-ossos","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/1f26021625d2e2e4b8ca84ebe942f854/ewcI4BpdaNjfLaahutp5MgA2scdl0v_large.jpg","description":"The first film in Pedro Costa’s transformative trilogy about Fontainhas, an impoverished quarter of Lisbon, Ossos is a tale of young lives torn apart by desperation. After a suicidal teenage girl gives birth, she misguidedly entrusts her baby’s safety to the troubled, deadbeat father, whose violent actions take the viewer on a tour of the foreboding, crumbling shantytown in which they live. With its reserved, shadowy cinematography by Emmanuel Machuel (who collaborated with Bresson on L’argent), Ossos is a haunting look at a devastated community.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Pedro Costa","slug":"pedro-costa"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Vanda Duarte","role":"Clotilde","slug":"vanda-duarte"},{"actor":"Nuno Vaz","role":"The father","slug":"nuno-vaz"},{"actor":"Maria Lipkina","role":"Tina","slug":"maria-lipkina"},{"actor":"Isabel Ruth","role":"Eduarda","slug":"isabel-ruth"},{"actor":"Inês Medeiros","role":"Whore","slug":"ines-medeiros"},{"actor":"Miguel Sermão","role":"Clotilde's husband","slug":"miguel-sermao"},{"actor":"Berta Susana Teixeira","role":"Nurse","slug":"berta-susana-teixeira"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Pedro Costa","slug":"pedro-costa"},{"role":"Writer","person":"Pedro Costa","slug":"pedro-costa"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Paolo Branco","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Emmanuel Machuel","slug":null},{"role":"Costume design","person":"Isabel Favila","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person":"Zé Branco","slug":null},{"role":"Sound","person":"Henri Maikoff","slug":null},{"role":"Sound","person":"Gérard Rousseau","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Jackie Bastide","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[439,